##Notes##
// Profil OpenPPL d'exemple : agressif (LAG), beaucoup de relances et de bluffs.

##f$preflop##
WHEN StackSize <= 10 AND handrank169 <= 90 RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND handrank169 <= 80 RaiseTo 2.5 FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND InBigBlind RaiseTo 3 FORCE
WHEN Raises >= 1 AND handrank169 <= 15 RaiseTo 8 FORCE
WHEN Raises >= 1 AND handrank169 <= 60 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Fold FORCE

##f$flop##
WHEN Raises = 0 AND random < 0.65 RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.70 RaisePot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.40 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE

##f$turn##
WHEN prwin > 0.72 RaisePot FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND random < 0.45 RaiseTwoThirdPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.45 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE

##f$river##
WHEN prwin > 0.75 RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND random < 0.30 RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.50 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE
